E1E2 A646             (    forth6809.asm):04038                     LDA   6,U
E1E4 E661             (    forth6809.asm):04039                     LDB   1,S
E1E6 3D               (    forth6809.asm):04040                     MUL
E1E7 EBE4             (    forth6809.asm):04041                     ADDB  ,S
E1E9 2401             (    forth6809.asm):04042                     BCC   UM1
