E2B5 CCFFFF           (    forth6809.asm):04198                     LDD   #-1
E2B8 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04199                     PSHU  D
E2BA 39               (    forth6809.asm):04200                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):04201         
