E723 DC14             (    forth6809.asm):05077                     LDD   MSCR
E725 3406             (    forth6809.asm):05078                     PSHS  D
E727 3410             (    forth6809.asm):05079                     PSHS  X
E729 39               (    forth6809.asm):05080                     RTS
