E737 9C21             (    forth6809.asm):05100         EXSCAN:     CMPX  CSP
E739 270E             (    forth6809.asm):05101                     BEQ   EXSCANDONE
E73B EC84             (    forth6809.asm):05102                     LDD   ,X
E73D 10830003         (    forth6809.asm):05103                     CMPD  #TAGDO
